hadiths[71]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1548","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se jo koi qasam khaaye...\"""""""
"1549","Ibn Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh sad bn abadh (rz all anh) nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say apny man ky trf say ayk ww (nzr) kay baray myn swal kya۔"
"1550","Salamah ibn Shabīb ne riwāyat kī, Abū al-Mughīrah ne riwāyat kī, ʿUfayr ibn Maʿdān se, Sulaym ibn ʿĀmir se, aur Abū Umāmah (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhu) se riwāyat hai ke Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: \Behtareen qurbānī kā jānwar bhailā hai aur behtareen kafan ḥullah (do tukdon kā libās) hai.\"" Abū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Ye ḥadīth gharīb hai aur ʿUfayr ibn Maʿdān ḥadīth ke riwāyat mein ḍaʿīf (kamzor) qarār diye jāte hain."""""
"1551","Abu Al-Bakhtari (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\n\Musalmaanon ki lashkaron mein se ek lashkar...\"""""""
"1552","Hazrat Ibn 'Asim Al-Muzani ne riwayat farmaya: Apne baap se aur woh ek Sahabi the ke: \Jab Rasool Allah (ﷺ) kisi lashkar ya daste ko bhejte\"""""""
"1553","Hadees ka Anas (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai: \Jab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Khaibar ki taraf rawana hue...\"""""""
"1554","Abu Talhah (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya:\n\n\Jab Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) kisi qaabeelay ko pakarne par aaye to teen raat un ki basti ke kinare par thehar jaate.\"""""""
"1555","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Bani Nadir ke khajoor ke darakht jala kar kaat diye, aur yeh kaam Al-Buwairah mein hua. Is par Allah Ta'ala ne yeh aayat nazil ki: \Aur jo tumne unke khajoor ke darakht kaat diye...\"""""""
"1556","Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \bhtryn sathy char hyn۔\"""""""
"1557","Yazid bin Hurmuz ne riwayat ki ke Najdah Al-Haruri ne Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ko likha ke kya Rasoolullah (ﷺ) auraton ke saath qila'at mein jang karte the?"
"1558","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' qurbani key janweron mein sab sey behtar mendhaa hai aur sab sey behtar kafan « حلة » ( tehband aur chadar ( hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- Afeer bin Maadaan hadees ki riwayat mein zaeef hain."
"1559","Hum log Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath maidan Arafat mein thehrey huye they, mainey aap ko farmatey suna : logo ! har ghar waley par har saal eik qurbani aur « عتيرة » (ateera) hai, tum log jantey ho « عتيرة » (ateera) kya hai? « عتيرة » (ateera) wo hai jisey tum log (rajbiya) kehtey ho. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum is ko ibne Aun hi ki sanad sey jantey hain."
"1560","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Hasan ki taraf sey eik bakri aqeeqa kiya, aur farmaya : ''Faatima ! iska sar moond do aur iskey baal key barabar chaandi sadqa karo.''  Fatima (Raziallahu Anha) ney uskey baal ko tola to uska wazan eik dirham key barabar ya us sey kuchh kam huwa. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- iski sanad muttasil nahin hai, aur Raavi Abu-Jafar Sadiq Muhammad bin Ali bin Husain ney Ali bin abi Talib ko nahin paya hai."
"1561","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney khutba diya, phir ( member sey) utrey phir aap ney do mendhey mangaaey aur in ko zibeh kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. (ye Eidul-Azha ki namaz key baad kiya tha, dekhey agli hadees)."
"1562","Main Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath Eidul-Azha key din Eid-gaah gaya, jab aap khutba khatam kar chukey to member sey nichey utrey, phir eik mendhaa laya gaya to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us ko apney haath sey zibeh kiya, aur (zibeh kartey waqt) ye kalimaat kahey : (بسم الله والله أكبر ، هذا عني وعمن لم يضح من أمتي). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai. 2- ehle-ilm Sahaba aur deegar logon ka isi par amal hai ke janwer zibeh kartey waqt aadmi ye kahey « بسم الله والله"
"1563","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''har bacha Aqeeqe key badley girwi rakha huwa hai padhi. , paidaish key saatwen din uska Aqeeqa kiya jaey, uska naam rakha jaey aur uskey sar key baal mundaaey jaeyn.''"
"1564","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo maah zil-hijj ka chaand dekhey aur qurbani karna chahta ho wo ( jab tak qurbani na kar ley ( apna baal aur nakhun na kaatey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- (Amr aur umr key barey mein) sahih Amr bin Muslim hai, in sey Muhammad bin Amr bin Alqama aur kaee logon ney hadees riwayat ki hai, dusri sanad sey isi jaisi hadees Saeed bin Musaiyab sey aai hai, Saeed bin Musaiyab abu-Salma sey aur abu-Salma Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka yehi qol hai, Saeed bin Musaiyab bhi isi key qaail hain, Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka maslak bhi isi hadees key muwaafiq hai. 4- baaz ehle-ilm ney is silsiley mein rukhsat di hai, wo log kehtey hain : baal aur nakhun kaatney mein koi harj nahin hai, Shafai ka yehi qol hai, wo Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki is hadees sey daleel detey hain, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam qurbani ka janwer Madina rawana kartey they aur mohrim jin chizon sey ijtinab (bacha) karta hai, aap un mein sey kisi chiz sey bhi ijtinab (bacha) nahin kartey they."
"1565","Hadees ka riwayat Ali (radi Allahu anhu) ne ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya ke Jibra'il (alaihis salaam) un par nazil hue thein aur unhein farmaya ke: \Unhein - yani apne Sahaba-e-Kiram (ridwan Allahu alaihim ajma'in) ko - Badr ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq faisla karne ki hidayat karo.\"""""""
"1566","Imran bin Husain (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne ek mushrik ke badle mein do Musalmanon ko fida farma diya. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] yeh Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Abu Al-Muhallab ke chacha ka naam Abdur Rahman bin Amr hai."
"1567","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki ek ghazwa mein ek aurat mardi hui mili."
"1568","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Sa'b bin Jaththamah (رضي الله عنہ) ne kaha: Maine kaha: \Aey Allah ke Rasool (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم)، ہمارے گھوڑوں نے مشرکین کی عورتوں اور بچوں کو روند دیا۔\"" آپ (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) نے فرمایا: \""وہ ان کے باپ سے ہیں۔\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) نے کہا:] یہ حدیث حسن صحیح ہے۔"""""
"1569","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne humein ek fauj ke saath bheja aur farmaya: 'Agar tum fulan aur fulan ko dekh lo"""""
"1570","Thawban (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs as say phlay mr jayay kh wh tyn chyzwn say pak hw: tkbr (kbr)...\"""""""
"1571","Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nThawban (razi Allahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ki rooh uske jism se is haal mein juda ho ke woh teen cheezon se paak ho: Kanz (dhakiyala daulat)...\"""""""
"1572","Simak Abu Rumail Al-Hanafi ne riwayat farmaya: \Main ne Ibn 'Abbas ko yeh kehte hue suna ke Umar bin Al-Khattab ne mujh se riwayat ki ke unhone kaha: 'Kaha gaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool! Falan shahid ho gaya.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahi! Main ne usay aag mein dekha"","" us kapde ki jo us ne ghanimat se chori kar liya tha.' Phir farmaya: 'Utho Umar! Pukaro ke jannat mein sirf momin hi dakhil honge.' Teen martaba.\"" [Abu 'Eisa ne kaha:] Yeh hadith Hasan Sahih Gharib hai."""""
"1573","Hadees ke mutabiq, Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنہ) ne bayan farmaya:\n\n\حضرت رسول اللہ ﷺ غزوے کے لیے ام سلیم (رضي الله عنہا) کو اپنے ساتھ لے جاتے تھے۔\"""""""
"1574","Qutaybah ne hamay sunaya, ʿAbd al-ʿAzīz ibn Muḥammad ne hamay sunaya, al-ʿAlāʾ ibn ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ne apne walid se riwāyat kī, aur unho ne Abū Hurayrah (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhu) se riwāyat kī ke Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: \Nadhr mat kiyā karo"","" kyunke nadhr qismat mein kuch bhi nahīṅ badaltā; yah to sirf bakhīl se (māl) nikālne kā zarīʿah hai.\"" Qāl: Is bāb mein Ibn ʿUmar (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhumā) kī bhi riwāyat hai. Abū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: Abū Hurayrah kī ḥadīth ḥasan ḥadīth hai. Is par ʿamal Ahl-e-ʿilm meṅ se baʿẓ Ṣaḥābah-e-Kirām (raḍiya Allāhu ʿanhum) aur ghair ke nazdīk hai"","" jinho ne nadhr karnā makrūh samjha. ʿAbdullāh ibn al-Mubārak ne farmāyā: Nadhr ke bāre meṅ karāhat kā maʿnī ṭāʿāt aur maʿāṣī dono par lāzim hai. Agar koi ādmī ṭāʿat kī nadhr kare aur adā kare"","" to usay us kā sawāb milegā"","" lekin nadhr karnā khud us ke liye makrūh hai."""""
"1575","Iyad bin Himar (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai ki unhon ne Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ko ya toh ek tohfa ya ek oont (camel) bheja."
"1576","Abu Bakrah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \nby krym ﷺ ky ksy aysay maamlay say mlaqat hwyy jw anhyn khwsh kr dynay wala tha۔\"""""""
"1577","Abu Al-Faid ne riwayat ki main ne Sulaim bin 'Amir ko yeh kehte huye suna: \n\Mu'awiyah aur Rome (Byzantium) ke logon ke darmiyan ek mu'ahida tha. Mu'awiyah un ke ilaqon mein ghazwa kar rahe taake jab mu'ahida khatam ho jaye to un par hamla kar saken. Ek din ek shaks ek sawar ke upar — ya ghode par baithe huye — ne pukar kar kaha: 'Allahu Akbar! Wafa"","" na ki khiyanat!' Yeh shaks Amr bin Abasa nikla. Mu'awiyah ne us se is ka sabab poocha. Unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne RasoolAllah (ﷺ) ko farmate suna: \""Jis shaks ke aur kisi qaum ke darmiyan mu'ahida ho...\""'\"""""""
"1578","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan us shakhsh ke liye jo khianat karega"","" Qayamat ke din uska ek jhanda khada kiya jayega.\"" [Ravi kehte hain:] Is mazmoon se mutaliq Ali (رضي الله عنہ) se bhi rivayatain hain."""""
"1579","# Tarjama-e-Hadith\n\n**Thābit ibn al-Ḍaḥḥāk (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) ne riwāyat farmāyā:**\n\nRasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā:\n\n> **\Jō shakhs Islām ke siwā kisī aur dīn kī kasam khā kar jhuṭī kasam khā'ē"","" tō woh jaisā kahēgā"","" waisā hō jā'egā.\""**\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: *\""Yeh ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hadīth hai.\""*\n\nUnhōnē yeh bhī farmāyā: *\""Ahl-e-ʿilm is bāb mein mukhtalif hain. Agar kō'ī ādmī Islām ke siwā kisī aur dīn kī kasam khā kar kahe ke 'Agar aisā kām kiyā tō maiṅ Yahūdī yā Naṣārā hūn"",""' aur phir wō kām kar lē"","" tō ba'z ahl-e-ʿilm kā qaul hai ke 'Usnē kabīrah gunāh kiyā aur us par kaffārah nahīṅ lāzim.' Yeh Madīnah ke ahl-e-ʿilm kā qaul hai aur Mālik ibn Anas ne bhī isī par fatwā diyā. Abū ʿUbayd bhī is rāy kē ḥāmil hain.*\n\n*Aur ba'z ahl-e-Ṣaḥābah (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam)"","" Tābiʿīn aur dūsrē ahl-e-ʿilm kā qaul hai ke 'Us par kaffārah lāzim hai.' Yeh Sufyān Thawrī"","" Aḥmad aur Isḥāq ibn Rāhawayh kā qaul hai.'\""*\n\n---\n\n**Maṣdar:** Jāmiʿ al-Tirmidhī"""""
"1580","Samurah bin Jundab (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mushrikon ke buzurgon ko qatal karo aur un mein se Sharkh ko chhod do.\"" Aur Sharkh woh larke hain jinhone abhi baal nahi ugne shuru kiye. [Abu 'Eisa ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Hajjaj bin Artah ne Qatadah se isi tarah rivayat ki hai."""""
"1581","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hamaare saath riwaayat kee: Abu al-Mughirah ne hamaare saath riwaayat kee: al-Awza'i ne hamaare saath riwaayat kee: al-Zuhri ne hamaare saath riwaayat kee, Humayd ibn 'Abd al-Rahman se, Abu Hurayrah (radhiyallahu 'anhu) se, unhone farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se jo koi qasam khaakar apni qasam mein kahay"","" 'Al-Lat aur al-'Uzza ki qasam"",""' to woh kahay"","" 'La ilaha illallah.' Aur jo koi kahay"","" 'Aao"","" main tum se juwa kheloon"",""' to woh sadaqah ada kare.\"" Abu 'Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: Yeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai. Abu al-Mughirah al-Khawlani al-Himsi hain"","" aur unka naam 'Abd al-Quddus ibn al-Hajjaj hai."""""
"1582","Qutaybah ne hamain sunaya: Layth ne hamain riwayat ki, Ibn Shihab se, Ubayd Allah ibn Abd ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas (radi Allahu anhum) se ki Saad ibn Ubadah (radi Allahu anhu) ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apni maa ki ek mannat ke baare mein sawal kiya jo unhone ki thi lekin ada karne se pehle wafat ho gayi. Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Tum uski taraf se ada karo.\"" Abu Isa (rahmatullah alaih) ne kaha: Yeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""""
"1583","Muhammad ibn 'Abd al-A'la ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki: Imran ibn Uyaynah — jo Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ke bhai hain — ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, Husayn se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Abu Umamah aur Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke deegar Sahaba-e-Kiram se, aur Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jo bhi Musalmaan mard ek Musalmaan ghulaam ko aazad kare"","" woh uske liye Jahannam ki aag se fidaya hoga; aazad kiye hue ghulaam ki har aza us mard ki mutalliq aza ka badla hoga. Aur jo bhi Musalmaan mard do Musalmaan ghulaam auraton ko aazad kare"","" woh uske liye Jahannam ki aag se fidaya hogi; un dono ki har aza us mard ki mutalliq aza ka badla hogi. Aur jo bhi Musalmaan aurat ek Musalmaan ghulaam aurat ko aazad kare"","" woh uske liye Jahannam ki aag se fidaya hogi; aazad kiye hue ghulaam aurat ki har aza us aurat ki mutalliq aza ka badla hogi.\"" Abu Isa ne kaha: Yeh is silsile se hasan sahih gharib hadith hai. Abu Isa ne yeh bhi kaha: Yeh hadith is baat ki dalalat karti hai ke ghulaam mard ko aazad karna ghulaam auraton ko aazad karne se zyada fazilat wala hai"","" is liye ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Jo koi Musalmaan ghulaam mard ko aazad kare"","" woh uske liye Jahannam ki aag se fidaya hoga; us ki har aza us ki mutalliq aza ka badla hogi.\"""""""
"1584","Simak Abu Rumail Al-Hanafi ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Ibn 'Abbas ko yeh kehte suna ke: 'Umar bin Al-Khattab ne mujh se riwayat ki ke unhone kaha: \""Kaha gaya: 'Ya Rasool Allah! Fulan shahid ho gaya.' Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahi! Main ne usay aag mein dekha"","" us kapde ki jo us ne ghanimat se chori ki thi.' Phir farmaya: 'Umar! Khade ho jao! Elaan karo ke iman walon ke siwa koi jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga.' Teen martaba.\"" [Abu 'Eisa ne kaha:] Yeh hadith Hasan Sahih Gharib hai."""""
"1585","Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Hazrat Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ghazwa ke waqt Hazrat Umm Sulaim (رضي الله"""""
"1586","Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anhu) se riwayat hai ke Jab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Khaybar ki taraf rawana hue, to raat ke waqt pahunchay. Jab bhi Woh (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) kisi qaum ke paas raat ko pahunchte, to subah hone tak hamla nahi karte the. Jab subah hui, to Yahood apni belon aur tokron ke saath bahar aaye. Jab unhone Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko dekha, to unhone kaha: \Muhammad (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) aur unki fauj aa gayi! Wallah"","" Muhammad (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apni fauj ke saath aa gaye hain!\"" Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Allahu Akbar! Khaybar tabah ho gaya! Yaqeenan jab hum kisi qaum ke maidan-e-darbaar par utarte hain"","" to azaab ki subah un logon ke liye buri hai jinhe khabardaar kar diya gaya hai.\"""""""
"1587","Iyad bin Himar (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay nby krym (ﷺ) kw ayk thfh ya awnt pysh kya۔"
"1588","Abu Bakrah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \n\nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) ky trf kwyy aysy bat phnchy jw anhyn khwsh kr dynay waly thy۔\"""""""
"1589","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Beshak ek aurat bhi aqwam ke liye aman de sakti hai — yani uski aman ko zaroor qabool karna chahiye — aur yeh aman Musalmanon ke liye wajib-e-izzat hai.\"""""""
"1590","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah un se) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n\Mujhe paighaamberon par cheezon se fazilat di gayi hai: Mujhe jawami' al-kalim (muhtasar aur vakalpurna bhashan) diya gaya hai"","" mujhe dushmanon ke dilon mein darr banaaya gaya hai (yaani terror se madad mili)"","" ghanimat-e-gharbe mujhe halal ki gayi hai"","" zameen mujhe masjid (namaz ki jagah) aur paak karne ka zariya banayi gayi hai"","" maine tamam khalq ko bheja gaya haur paighaamberi ka khatam mujh par hua.\""\n\nYeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""""
"1591","Aur Al-Walid bin Rabah ne Abu Hurairah radiAllahu anhu se suna, aur woh hadees mein Muqarib (aala darje ke) hain. \nJam'e Tirmizi Hadees: 1579, Arabi Hadees: 1579"
"1592","Abu Al-Faid ne riwayat ki: Main ne Sulaim bin Amir ko yeh kehte huay suna ke Muawiyah ke aur Rome (Rum) walon ke darmiyan ahd (treaty) tha. Woh un ki sarzamin ki taraf hamla karne ke liye nikalta taake jab ahd ki muddat khatam ho to un par hamla kar de. Ek din ek shakhs sawari par — ya kehne wale hain ghode par — chilla kar bola: \Allahu Akbar! Wafa"","" na ke ghaddar!\"" Yeh Amr bin Abasah nikla. Muawiyah ne us se is bare mein pucha. Us ne kaha: \""Main ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmate huay suna: 'Jis shakhs ke aur kisi qaum ke darmiyan ahd ho...\"""""""
"1593","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan us shakhsh ke liye jo khianat karega"","" Qayamat ke Din uska ek jhanda khada kiya jayega.\"" [Unhon ne kaha:] Is mauzoo par 'Ali (رضي الله عنہ) se bhi rivayaten hain."""""
"1594","# hdys ka trjmh\n\n**qtybh nay hmyn rwayt ky؛ hatm bn asmaayl nay rwayt ky، jafr bn mhmd say، an kay wald say، yzyd bn hrmz say، kh njdh harwry nay abn abas rz all anma kw kht lkha awr an say swal kya: \kya rswl allh ﷺ awrtwn kw lshkr kay sath jngy mhmat pr lay jatay thay، awr kya an kay lyay ghnymt ka hsh tay kya jata tha\""**\n\n**abn abas rz all anma nay kh an kw jwab lkha: \""tm nay mjhay kht lkha kh kya rswl allh ﷺ jngy mhmat pr awrtwn kw sath lay jatay thay۔ albth، aap ﷺ anhyn sath lay jatay thay، wh zkhmywn ky dykh bhal krty thyn awr anhyn ghnymt myn say sdqh/bkhshsh kay twr pr kchh dya jata tha (yhbzyn)، lykn mqrrh hsh (shm) kay baray myn tw aap ﷺ nay an kay lyay kwyy sabt shdh hsh tay nhyn kya\""**\n\n**as bab myn ans rz all an awr am atyh rz all ana say bhy rwayat mwjwd hyn**\n\n**yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ aksryt alma kay aml ka as pr mbny hay، awr yh sfyan swry awr shafay ka mwqf hay**\n\n**an myn say baz nay kha: \""awrt awr bchay kay lyay ghnymt ka hsh tay kya jana chahyay۔\"" yh awzaay ka mwqf hay**\n\n**awzaay nay kha: \""nby krym ﷺ nay khybr myn lrkwn kay lyay hsay tay kyay، awr mslmanwn kay srdarwn nay jng ky srzmyn myn pyda hwnay walay hr nwzayydh bchay kay lyay hsh tay kya\""**\n\n**awzaay nay yh bhy kha: \""nby krym ﷺ nay khybr myn awrtwn kay lyay hsay tay kyay، awr aap ﷺ kay bad mslmanwn nay as pr aml kya\""**\n\n**aly bn khshrm nay hm say rwayt ky؛ aysy bn ywns nay hm say awzaay say asy kay mtabq rwayt ky**\n\n**aap ﷺ kay qwl \""yhbzyn mn alghnymh\"" ka mtlb yh hay kh anhyn ghnymt myn say btwr sdqh/bkhshsh (yzrkh lhn) dya jata tha، yany as myn say anhyn thfh dya jata tha۔**"""""
"1595","Samurah bin Jundab (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \mshrkyn kay brhwn kw qtl krw awr an myn shrkh kw chhwr dw۔\"" awr shrkh wh lrkay hyn jn kay bal abhy nhyn agay۔ [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ hjaj bn artah nay qtadh say asy trh rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"1596","Hazrat Atiyyah Al-Qurazi (rhmh allh taalyٰ) say rwayt hay: \hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn qbylh qryzh kay dn pysh kyay gyay۔ js kay bal shady (bal zyrِ btn) hw gyay thay asay qtl kr dya gya awr js kay nhyn hwyay thay asay chhwr dya gya۔ myn an lwgwn myn say tha jn kay bal shady nhyn hwyay thay، as lyay mjhay bhy chhwr dya gya\""\n\nabw aysy (rhmh allh) nay frmaya: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ ahlِ alm myn say baz ka aml asy pr hay۔ wh bal shady kw blwght ky alamt smjhtay hyn۔"""""
"1597","Imam al-Bukhari (rahimahullah) ne sahih hadith rivayat ki hain."
"1598","Bajalah bin 'Abdah ne riwayat ki ke main Jaz' bin Mu'awiyah ke liye Manadhir mein katib tha jab Umar (radiyallahu 'anhu) ka khat hamare paas aaya ke: \Apne aas paas ke Majusiyon ka jaanch karo aur un se jizyah lo. Kyunki Abdur-Rahman bin 'Awf (radiyallahu 'anhu) ne mujhe bataya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa samm) ne Hajar ke Majusiyon se jizyah li thi.\"" [Abu 'Eisa ne kaha: yeh hadith hasan hai.]"""""
"1599","Bajalah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh hzrt amr (rz all anh) mjwsywn say jzyh nhyn lytay thay yhan tk kh hzrt abdalrhmn bn awf (rz all anh) nay anhyn btaya kh nby akrm ﷺ nay hjr kay mjwsywn say jzyh lya tha۔ as hdys myn as say zyadh gftgw bhy hay۔ awr yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔"
"1600","Hummein yeh riwayat sunayi gayi ke Hannad ne kaha: Hummein Ibn Al-Mubarak ne riwayat ki, Haywah ibn Shurayh se, unhone kaha: Maine Rabi'ah ibn Yazid Al-Dimashqi ko yeh kehte suna: Abu Idris Al-Khulani, 'A'idhullah ibn 'Ubaydullah ne mujhe bataya ke unhone Abu Tha'labah Al-Khushni ko kehte suna: Maine Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ke paas aaya aur kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Hum Ahle Kitaab ki zameen mein hain aur unke bartanon se khate hain.\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Agar tum aur bartan mil jayein to un se na khao. Agar tumhein koi aur bartan na mile to unhein dho kar un se khao.\"" Abu 'Isa (At-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: Yeh Hadith Hasan (achhi) aur Sahih (mustanad) hai."""""
"1601","Uqbah bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki keh: Maine kaha: \Ya Rasoolallah! Hum log kisi qaum ke paas aate hain aur woh humein mehmaan nahi banate...\"""""""
"1602","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Hannād ne hamain bayān farmāyā** — Ibn Abī az-Zinād ne hamain bayān farmāyā, apne wālid se, ʿUbaydullāh ibn ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿUtbah se, Ibn ʿAbbāṣ (rzy allh anhma) se, nby akrm ﷺ nay jng bdr kay dn apny tlwar Dhū al-Faqār kw apna nfl (tanaffala) bnaya، awr yhy wh tlwar thy js kay baray myn aap ﷺ nay jng ahd kay dn khwab dykha tha\n\nyh ayk *ḥasan gharīb* hdys hay۔ hm asay srf asy snd say jantay hyn، abn aby alznad ky hdys say\n\nalmaa ka nfl (bonus share) kay hwalay say khms (one-fifth) myn say dynay kay baray myn akhtlaf hay۔ malk bn ans nay frmaya: \mjh tk yh nhyn phncha kh rswl allh ﷺ nay apny tmam ghzwon myn nfl dya hw؛ albth mjh tk yh phncha hay kh aap ﷺ nay baz ghzwon myn nfl dya۔ yh amam ka ajthad ka maamlh tha، khyr ghnymt kay shrwa myn hw ya aakhr myn\""\n\nabn mnswr nay frmaya: \""myn nay ahmd say kha: 'nby akrm ﷺ rwangy kay wqt khms kay bad chwthayy nfl dytay thay awr wapsy kay wqt khms kay bad thayy nfl dytay thay۔' anhwn nay (ahmd nay) frmaya: 'aap ﷺ phlay khms nkaltay، phr baqy mandh myn say nfl dytay، awr as say zyadh nhyn dytay thay\""\n\nabw aysyٰ (trmzy) nay frmaya: \""yh hdys abn almsyb kay as qwl kay mtabq hay — kh nfl khms myn say hay۔\"" ashaq nay bhy yhy kha۔"""""
"1603","# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Abu Qatada (Razi Allah un se) ne riwayat ki:**\n\nRasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n**\Jo shakhs kisi dushman jungjoo ko"","" jis ke liye wazeh daleel (jung mein qatal ke liye mashroo' haisiyat) ho"","" qatal kare"","" to us ka salab (maal-e-ghaneemat) usi ka hoga.\""**\n\n---\n\n**Imam Abu Isa (Rahmatullah Alaih) ne farmaya:** *\""Is hadith mein ek lambi qissa (riwayat) bhi hai.\""*\n\n---\n\n## Uloomi Wazahat:\n\n- **إسناد (Isnad):** Riwayat ka silsila **Al-Ansari → Ma'n → Malik ibn Anas → Yahya ibn Sa'id → Umar ibn Kathir ibn Aflah → Abu Muhammad"","" Abu Qatada ki azad ki hui jariya → Abu Qatada** (Razi Allah un se) se guzarta hai.\n\n- **سلب (Salab):** Is se murad woh shakhs asbaab"","" silah"","" aur jung ka saamaan hai jo kisi qatal shuda dushman jungjoo se us shakhs ke haath se liya jaye"","" jis ne us ka qatal kiya ho. Fuqaha (fuqaha-e-kiram) ne is mas'ale par mukhtalif ahkaam diye hain"","" jo imam ke ikhtiyar aur haalat par mabni hain.\n\n- **"""""
"1604","Yazid bin Abi Ubaid ne riwayat kiya keh Maine Salamah bin Akwa (رضي الله عنه) se poocha keh \Aap ne Hudaibiyyah ke din Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke liye kis cheez ki bayat ki thi?\"" Unhon ne farmaya keh \""Maut ki.\"" Hadith Hasan Sahih hai."""""
"1605","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke paas sunne aur ita'at ki bay'at karte the.\"" Aap (ﷺ) humse farmaate the: \""Qadr-e-istita'at ke mutabiq.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (rahimahullah) ne kaha: Yeh hadith hai Hasan Sahih.]"""""
"1606","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh: \hm nay rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) say mwt ky byat nhyn ky۔\"""""""
"1607","Abu Horaira (ra) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Teen aise hain ki Qiyamat ke Din un se Allah (swt) baat nahi karega.\"""""""
"1608","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Ek ghulaam Nabi (ﷺ) ke paas Hijrat ki bay'at dene aaya.\"""""""
"1609","Ibn Al-Munkadir ne Umaimah bin Ruqaiqah ko kehte suna keh woh keh rahi thin: \Main ne kuch auraton ke saath Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke liye bay'at ki. Aap (ﷺ) ne hum se farmaya: 'Jitna tum mein ho sake aur qabil ho.' Maine kaha: 'Allah aur Uska Rasool (ﷺ) hum par hum se zyada rehmat farmaan hain.'\"""""""
"1610","Al-Bara' (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \Hum kehte thay ke Badr ke din Badr mein shareek hone wale Talut ("""""
"1611","**Hadees ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu):**\n\nHazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne Abdul-Qais ki ek delegation se farmaya: \n**\Main tumhe hukum deta hoon ke tum ghaneemat-e-maal se Khumus (khums) ada karo.\""** \n\nYeh farmaya gaya hai ke is Hadees ke saath ek qissa bhi hai. \n\nAbu Eisa (رحمه"""""
"1612","# trjmh\n\n**Ibn Abi 'Umar nay rwayt kya، Sufyan nay rwayt kya، Ayyub nay rwayt kya، Abu Qilabah say، an kay chcha say، Imran ibn Husayn say kh nby akrm allh kh alyh alslw walslam nay dw mslman kw ayk mshrk kay bdlay fdyh d kr aazad kya**\n\nAbu 'Isa nay kha: yh ayk hsn shyh hdys hay۔ Abu Qilabah kay chcha Abu al-Muhallab hyn، an ka nam 'Abd al-Rahman ibn 'Amr hay، awr kha jata hay kh an ka nam Mu'awiyah ibn 'Amr hay۔ Abu Qilabah ka nam 'Abd Allah ibn Zayd al-Jarmi hay\n\nzyadh tr alma ka — jw nby akrm allh kh alyh alslw walslam kay shabh kram awr dygr myn say hyn — aml yh hay kh amam ksy bhy qydy kw chahay tw aazad kr skta hay، ksy kw chahay tw qtl kr skta hay، awr ksy kw chahay tw fdyh d kr aazad kr skta hay\n\nbaz alma nay fdyh kay mqablay myn qtl kw trjyh dy hay۔ Al-Awza'i nay kha: \mjhay yh phncha hay kh yh aayt mnswkh hay — allh taalyٰ kay frman: 'phr bad myn ya tw aazad krw ya fdyh dw' — awr asay as aayt nay mnswkh kr dya: 'awr anhyn hr jhan pao qtl krw'\""\n\nhmyn Hannad kay zryaay yh khbr dy gyy، Ibn al-Mubarak nay rwayt kya، Al-Awza'i say\n\nIshaq ibn Mansur nay kha: myn nay Ahmad say pwchha: \""jb qydy lya jayay tw kya asay qtl kya jayay ya fdyh d kr aazad kya jayay — aap kwn sa aml psnd krtay hyn؟\"" anhwn nay frmaya: \""agr wh asay fdyh d kr aazad kr skyn tw as myn kwyy hrj nhyn۔ awr agr wh qtl kr dyn tw myn as myn bhy kwyy hrj nhyn janta\""\n\nIshaq ibn Ibrahim nay kha: \""qtl mjhay zyadh psnd hay، mgr yh kh qydy marwf hw، aysy swrt myn mjhay amyd hay kh as kay zryaay bht sy [faydh] hasl krwn ga۔\"""""""
"1613","Hazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs lwt mar kray ga tw wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔\"" [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] yh hdys hsn shyh ghryb hay، hzrt ans (rz all anh) ky rwayt kay twr pr۔"""""
"1614","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yahoodiyon aur Nasaron se salaam mein peeche mat rehna. Aur agar tum mein se kisi ko raaste mein un mein se kisi ka saamna ho"","" toh usey aise jagah par chalne par majboor karo jahan uski chalne ki jagah tang ho.\"""""""
"1615","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab koi Yahudi tum mein se kisi ko salaam de...\"""""""
"1616","Qais bin Abu Hazim ne riwayat kih Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah (رضی اللہ عنہ) se naqil kiya کہ رسول اللہ ﷺ نے خثام کی طرف ایک لشکر بھیجا۔ پھر وہاں کے کچھ لوگ سجدہ کر کے امن کی درخواست کر لی۔"
"1617","Qais bin Abu Hazim ne riwayat ki: Abu Mu'aqiyah ki riwayat (jumla 1604) ke mithal, lekin is mein unhone \Jarir se\"" ka zikr nahi kiya."""""
"1618","Hazrat Umar ibn al-Khattab (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \agr myn zndh rha – agr allh nay chaha – tw myn yhwdywn awr msyhywn kw jzyrh arb say akhraj kr dwn ga۔\"""""""
